        <profile id="833226c8" name="Enhancement: Crusaders' Fervour (Warlord)" typeId="a915f3e9" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Righteous Defiance: The bearer has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability. In addition, once per battle, when the bearer's unit is selected as the target of an attack, it can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, models in the bearer's unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability.)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
