          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">Melee weapons equipped by the bearer have the [PRECISION] ability. Melee weapons equipped by the bearer have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability while targeting Character units. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Halo of Detestation: Each time a ranged attack targets the bearer's unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.)</characteristic>
